From fb4461787c54443783410ade4dc3562222b80da0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 15:59:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Comments of the generic-parallel interfaces updated,
 preexisting documentation errors fixed

Memory space of the batches, sycl queues (required, in-order for the
asynchronous computations), lists of backends, conventions of the
backends of the material properties, generated documentation (strides,
parameters of the constructor, order of the arguments of the initialize
functions). Preexisting errors in the touched files: misplaced comments,
wrong parameter names, template parameters documented as parameters.
